  "content": "\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\">\n  </a>\n</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n# 樹木採掘者\n\n這是一個 Minecraft 資料包，當你蹲下時破壞原木，它會自動砍倒整棵樹。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wEhW4ceB/images/32390c308957b4fd88e0a12083649cd56b1ce576.gif\" alt=\"樹木採掘者預覽\">\n</p>\n\n## 注意事項\n\n- 樹木採掘者僅在你蹲下（潛行）時才會啟動\n- 若只想破壞單一原木方塊，請在沒有蹲下的情況下正常破壞它\n- 樹葉會掉落正常的物品（樹苗、木棍），與手動破壞相同\n- 每次使用之間設有短暫冷卻時間，以防止效能問題",
